WEBVTT

00:13:57.294 --> 00:14:01.929
Dakle, da, verujem da je žalost
kod životinja stvarna.

00:14:01.953 --> 00:14:04.138
Verujem u postojanje ljubavi kod životinja

00:14:04.162 --> 00:14:06.672
i smatram da je vreme da mi ljudi

00:14:06.696 --> 00:14:09.799
prepoznamo da to nije naša svojina.

00:14:09.836 --> 00:14:11.366
Kada to uvidimo,

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:15.204
imamo priliku da učinimo svet
mnogo boljim za životinje,

00:14:15.228 --> 00:14:17.531
prijatnijim, nežnijim,

00:14:17.555 --> 00:14:22.052
a usput bismo mogli spasiti i sami sebe.

00:14:22.076 --> 00:14:23.568
Mnogo vam hvala.

00:14:23.592 --> 00:14:25.193
(Aplauz)

00:14:25.217 --> 00:14:26.980
Hvala. Hvala.

00:14:27.004 --> 00:14:28.833
(Aplauz)